msgid "%d Chars"
msgstr "Tarehintsoratra %d"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Slowlog Table Names [ optional ]"
msgstr "Anaran'ny Tabilao Slowlog [ tsy voatery ]"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Leave Blank for Auto Detection which runs must faster."
msgstr "Avelao ho foana ho an'ny Famantarana Mandeha Ho Azy izay haingana lavitra."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Famantarana ny Tabilao Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Ny fomba hanavahana ny tabilao teratany Cacti amin'ny tabilao hafa voatonona ao amin'ny tantaran'ny fangatahana miadana. Ny voafaritra mialoha dia mamantatra ny tabilao rehetra tsy misy fanambarana."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Fantaro ny tabilao rehetra (tsy misy fanambarana 'TABILAO HAFA')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Ampiasao ity Tahiry angona Cacti ity; atambaro ho 'TABILAO HAFA' ny tabilao hafa"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Fantaro ny tabilao rehetra; atambaro ho 'TABILAO HAFA' ny tabilao tsy ao amin'ny lisitra eto ambany"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Tabilao Mahaliana"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Ampiasaina amin'ny safidy 'Fantaro ny tabilao rehetra; atambaro ... ho TABILAO HAFA' etsy ambony ihany. Omeo lisitry ny tabilao fantatra sarahina elanelana mba hampitahaina azafady. Ao amin'ny Linux/UNIX, azonao alaina ny lisitry ny tabilao amin'ny fampiasana ity baiko ity:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>mpampiasa</b></i> -p<i><b>tenimiafina</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>tahiry_angona</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>Ny sandan'ny '<i><b>mpampiasa</b></i>', '<i><b>tenimiafina</b></i>', ary '<i><b>tahiry_angona</b></i>' dia soloina amin'ny sandanao."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Fetran'ny Fampakarana"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Fetran'ny haben'ny rakitra azo ampiakarina ao amin'ny Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Haben'ny Rakitra Ambony Indrindra Azo Ampiakarina"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ny haben'ny rakitra ambony indrindra avelan'ny mpizara Apache ampiakarina dia apetraka amin'ny sanda eo ankavanana.  Amin'izao fotoana izao dia tsy afaka mampakatra rakitra lehibe noho izany ianao.  Raha manana tantara miadana MySQL lehibe noho izany ianao, dia tsy maintsy manova ny rakitra <i>php.ini</i> mifandray amin'ny Apache, mitady ny variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> ary mampitombo ny sandany.  Aorian'izay dia tsy maintsy averina alefa ny Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Habe POST Ambony Indrindra"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ny habe ambony indrindra azonao alefa (POST) amin'ny mpizara Apache dia apetraka amin'ny sanda eo ankavanana.  Raha manana tantara miadana MySQL lehibe noho izany sanda izany ianao, dia tsy maintsy manova ny rakitra <i>php.ini</i> mifandray amin'ny Apache, mitady ny variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> ary mampitombo ny sandany.  Aorian'izay dia tsy maintsy averina alefa ny Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Fotoana Fanatanterahana Ambony Indrindra"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Hafiriana (amin'ny segondra) no avela handehanan'ity fangatahana ity; ny 0 dia midika hoe tsy voafetra. Efa mampiakatra izany ho tsy voafetra ho an'ny fangatahany manokana ity fanampiny ity, saingy ny mpizara web na reverse proxy eo anoloan'ny PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) dia mbola afaka manapaka ny fangatahana samirery - tsy azo fantarina na foanana eto izany."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Tsy voafetra"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Fetran'ny Tadidy"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Hatraiza ny tadidy avela hampiasain'ity fangatahana ity; ny -1 dia midika hoe tsy voafetra. Efa mampiakatra izany ho tsy voafetra ho an'ny fangatahany manokana ity fanampiny ity. Ny tantaran'ny fangatahana miadana lehibe dia lehibe vakiana/afarana ao anatin'ny fangatahana iray dia mety hihoatra ny sanda voafetra."

